From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Erfan Abdi <erfangplus@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 4 Nov 2026 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] linker: dladdr gives the library's full path

dladdr's dli_fname was the soinfo's base name; Android's dladdr gives the full path (soinfo::get_realpath). Code that finds its sibling
libraries from its own path got a relative name: GeckoView's utility process looks for libmozavutil/libmozavcodec next to libmozglue
(dladdr(&malloc)), gave up, and so had no ffvpx decoder ("no decoder found for audio/opus": WebM audio did not play).

apklayer patch 0030 of patches/bionic_translation.
---
 linker/dlfcn.c | 4 +++-
 1 file changed, 3 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/linker/dlfcn.c b/linker/dlfcn.c
--- a/linker/dlfcn.c
+++ b/linker/dlfcn.c
@@ -226,7 +226,9 @@
 	if (si) {
 		memset(info, 0, sizeof(*info));

-		info->dli_fname = si->name;
+		/* apklayer patch: the full path, as Android's dladdr gives (si->name is the base name): code that finds its sibling libraries
+		 * from its own path (GeckoView's ffvpx loader: dladdr(&malloc) in libmozglue) got a relative name and gave up */
+		info->dli_fname = si->fullpath[0] ? si->fullpath : si->name;
 		info->dli_fbase = (void *)(uintptr_t)si->base;

 		/* Determine if any symbol in the library contains the specified address */
